<title>UK: CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DERBY, England 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third</p>
<p>and final day of the match between Derbyshire and Australia on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 362-6 declared (G.Blewett 121,</p>
<p>M.Elliott 67, M.Bevan 56)</p>
<p>Derbyshire first innings 257-9 declared (M.May 67)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 148-2)</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Harris				  4</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Krikken b Aldred		    63</p>
<p> J.Langer lbw b Dean				12</p>
<p> M.Bevan not out				   104</p>
<p> B.Julian c Jones b Dean			  62</p>
<p> S.Warne not out				     2</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-4 nb-12)			  18</p>
<p>Total (for 4 wickets declared, 66 overs)  265</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-5 2-35 3-159 4-260.</p>
<p>Bowling: DeFreitas 10-3-31-0, Harris 16-3-49-1, Blackwell</p>
<p>9-1-49-0, Dean 10-0-45-2, Aldred 15-1-65-1, Rollins 2-0-12-0,</p>
<p>Clarke 4-1-8-0.</p>
